IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cema-types`
IMPORT `cema-forfeiture`
IMPORT `cema-penalties`
IMPORT `cema-time-limits`

-- Customs and Excise Management Act 1979 (UK) — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.
--
--   "Goods were seized and someone may be prosecuted for fraudulent evasion:
--    notice of seizure, the claim deadline and condemnation; the maximum
--    penalties; and the last day to commence proceedings."

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Customs case` HAS
    `the seizure`                                       IS A MAYBE `Seizure facts`
    `the evasion`                                       IS A MAYBE `Evasion facts`
    `the offence timing`                                IS A MAYBE `Offence timing`

DECLARE `Customs position` HAS
    `notice of seizure required`                        IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day for a notice of claim`                    IS A MAYBE DATE
    `condemnation outcome`                              IS A MAYBE `Condemnation outcome`
    `offence under s 170`                               IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `maximum penalties`                                 IS A MAYBE `Maximum penalties`
    `last day to commence proceedings`                  IS A MAYBE DATE

@ref ss 139(6), 146A, 149, 170, Sch 1, Sch 3
@export default The position under the Customs and Excise Management Act 1979 (UK) for seized goods and a prosecution for fraudulent evasion: whether notice of seizure must be given, the last day for a notice of claim, and whether the thing is deemed condemned or must go to court (Sch 3); whether an offence under s 170 is made out and the maximum penalties (NOTHING if not); and the last day to commence proceedings (s 146A). DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS A `Customs case`  @desc Any seizure, any evasion, and the offence dates
GIVETH A `Customs position`
`the customs position for` c MEANS
    `Customs position` WITH
        `notice of seizure required`                    IS
            CONSIDER c's `the seizure`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST s  THEN JUST (`notice of seizure must be given for` s)
        `last day for a notice of claim`                IS
            CONSIDER c's `the seizure`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST s  THEN JUST (`the last day for a notice of claim for` s)
        `condemnation outcome`                          IS
            CONSIDER c's `the seizure`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST s  THEN JUST (`the condemnation outcome for` s)
        `offence under s 170`                           IS
            CONSIDER c's `the evasion`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST e  THEN JUST (`an offence under s 170 is made out by` e)
        `maximum penalties`                             IS
            CONSIDER c's `the evasion`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST e  THEN IF `an offence under s 170 is made out by` e THEN JUST (`the maximum penalties under s 170 for` e) ELSE NOTHING
        `last day to commence proceedings`              IS
            CONSIDER c's `the offence timing`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST t  THEN JUST (`the last day to commence proceedings for` t)
